    "The shared 232 ms unchanged-update observation in the initial run arrived as a compressed burst. It does not independently establish a physical 232 ms D1 wait.",
    "D1 metadata exposes SQL time and attempt counts. It does not divide dispatch, service queueing, durable acknowledgement, transport or selective binding callback scheduling.",
    "Worker placement was configured for Singapore. Native Worker execution location was not verified because the telemetry endpoint returned HTTP 403. Every database statement reported a Singapore primary.",
    "This one-row workload reproduces the delay class outside the Wallet runtime. It does not reproduce the full wallet lifecycle or establish production percentile rates.",
